> asymptotic
> model component to work in inlabru (first choice), but the characteristics I
> mentioned
> above make it hard to clamp down on initial values and get reliable
> convergence.
>
> Finn, I'd like to try an rw2 constrained to (0, 0). Can either of you point me
> to an example
> of how that is done in inla() or bru()?
